      "parameters": {
        "content": "# SEKALUM\n## Error Cases\n\nConfigure the two n8n credentials described in the Quick Start before running this example:\n- Invalid Consumer Token → a Sekalum API credential with an intentionally invalid token.\n- Missing Consumer Grant → a valid Consumer token, an existing Credential, and no matching Consumer Grant.\n\nExpected boundaries: HTTP 401 `API_TOKEN_AUTH_FAILED` and HTTP 403 `RESOLVE_NOT_AVAILABLE`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460
      },
